   "end": 4.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "(whispering) This can't be true.",
   "scene_id": 1,
   "is_recap": true,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L1",
   "start": 4.0,
   "end": 6.0,
   "type": "scene",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "INT. MIRA'S APARTMENT - NIGHT",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L2",
   "start": 6.0,
   "end": 11.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "A small one-room flat. Rain on the window. The legal document lies open on the kitchen table.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L3",
   "start": 11.0,
   "end": 15.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Desai sits across from Mira, drinking tea from a chipped cup.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L4",
   "start": 15.0,
   "end": 20.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "Your father's will is clear. Everything goes to his only child.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L5",
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 26.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "I don't want his money. I want to know why my mother cried every birthday.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L6",
   "start": 26.0,
   "end": 32.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "Then you will want to read his letters. He wrote to her for years. She never opened them.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L7",
   "start": 32.0,
   "end": 37.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "He places a bundle of yellowed letters on the table, tied with string.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L8",
   "start": 37.0,
   "end": 41.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira touches the string but does not untie it.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L9",
   "start": 41.0,
   "end": 45.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "Does anyone at the Mehta Group know who I am?",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L10",
   "start": 45.0,
   "end": 51.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "No one. The board only knows the heir will be announced at the investors' gala.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L11",
   "start": 51.0,
   "end": 53.0,
   "type": "scene",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "INT. MIRA'S APARTMENT - LATER",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L12",
   "start": 53.0,
   "end": 57.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Desai is gone. Mira waters a dying plant on the windowsill.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L13",
   "start": 57.0,
   "end": 61.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "A knock. Tanya stands at the door holding a bakery box.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L14",
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 64.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "TANYA",
   "text": "I brought your favourite. Can we talk?",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L15",
   "start": 64.0,
   "end": 68.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira lets her in without a word. Tanya sets the box down.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L16",
   "start": 68.0,
   "end": 73.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "TANYA",
   "text": "I didn't have a choice. Mrs. Mehta would have fired me too.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L17",
   "start": 73.0,
   "end": 76.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "You're wearing one earring.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L18",
   "start": 76.0,
   "end": 78.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Tanya touches her bare earlobe.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L19",
   "start": 78.0,
   "end": 81.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "TANYA",
   "text": "I must have lost it somewhere.",
   "scene_id": 3,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L20",
   "start": 81.0,
   "end": 83.0,
   "type": "scene",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "EXT. MEHTA MANSION - DRIVEWAY - NIGHT",
   "scene_id": 4,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L21",
   "start": 83.0,
   "end": 89.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira returns Arjun's car keys to the valet stand. She checks the passenger seat of his silver car.",
   "scene_id": 4,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L22",
   "start": 89.0,
   "end": 94.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Wedged in the seat is a pearl earring. The pair of the one Tanya was wearing.",
   "scene_id": 4,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L23",
   "start": 94.0,
   "end": 98.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira holds it up to the light. Her face shows nothing.",
   "scene_id": 4,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L24",
   "start": 98.0,
   "end": 100.0,
   "type": "scene",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "INT. MIRA'S APARTMENT - NIGHT",
   "scene_id": 5,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L25",
   "start": 100.0,
   "end": 103.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira picks up her phone and dials.",
   "scene_id": 5,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L26",
   "start": 103.0,
   "end": 107.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "Mr. Desai? Tell the board I accept.",
   "scene_id": 5,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L27",
   "start": 107.0,
   "end": 111.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "But nobody learns my name until the gala.",
   "scene_id": 5,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E3_L28",
   "start": 111.0,
   "end": 113.0,
   "type": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "CUT TO BLACK.",
   "scene_id": 5,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  }
 ],
